    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2578050/extras/47c3ec25b02eaa69e80001773bbe3177.avif?t=1750225419\" width=600 height=143 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Fishing Echoes, elemental forces await. Track down clues with each catch and get prepared for epic boss battles in this thrilling fishing adventure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2578050/extras/84eef0505d839c00590569145d2d73bf.avif?t=1750225419\" width=600 height=70 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2578050/extras/e1eca6088859d8d866d22cea7d72b342.avif?t=1750225419\" width=600 height=143 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2578050/extras/ab90f39ecbff3b3203154e5bfea51c9b.poster.avif?t=1750225419\" width=616 height=142 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2578050/extras/ab90f39ecbff3b3203154e5bfea51c9b.webm?t=1750225419\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2578050/extras/ab90f39ecbff3b3203154e5bfea51c9b.mp4?t=1750225419\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Elemental fish present a distinct challenge with their powerful statuses. These fish can manipulate elements to hinder your progress. Adapt your strategies, outwit their elemental tricks, and capture them to turn the tide in your favour.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2578050/extras/9c9e1827190cc19df76434bc76f87aac.poster.avif?t=1750225419\" width=616 height=142 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2578050/extras/9c9e1827190cc19df76434bc76f87aac.webm?t=1750225419\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2578050/extras/9c9e1827190cc19df76434bc76f87aac.mp4?t=1750225419\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Follow clues about fish habits to fine-tune your fishing techniques. Use this knowledge to outsmart and catch the most elusive fish. Master the art of tracking and adapt your approach to each fish. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2578050/extras/cc8d149ee28c165f8a8a6e17191c1951.poster.avif?t=1750225419\" width=616 height=142 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2578050/extras/cc8d149ee28c165f8a8a6e17191c1951.webm?t=1750225419\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2578050/extras/cc8d149ee28c165f8a8a6e17191c1951.mp4?t=1750225419\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect and complete your fish catalogue by catching every species. Fill your collection with rare and diverse catches! Showcase your achievements and become a master angler with a comprehensive and impressive collection.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2578050/extras/cde458703159db96c488d333fdc8e575.poster.avif?t=1750225419\" width=616 height=142 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2578050/extras/cde458703159db96c488d333fdc8e575.webm?t=1750225419\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2578050/extras/cde458703159db96c488d333fdc8e575.mp4?t=1750225419\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore how the shifting day-night cycle influences which fish are active. Tailor your fishing approach to different times and increase your chances of finding rare and unique species.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2578050/extras/82bbf41405192447e59d66a1e27a0fa6.poster.avif?t=1750225419\" width=616 height=142 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2578050/extras/82bbf41405192447e59d66a1e27a0fa6.webm?t=1750225419\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2578050/extras/82bbf41405192447e59d66a1e27a0fa6.mp4?t=1750225419\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Travel to distinctive biomes and uncover unique fishing spots. Explore new locations, expand your adventure, and conquer fresh challenges.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2578050/extras/a3450500015debd6b108c527d7260b82.poster.avif?t=1750225419\" width=616 height=142 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2578050/extras/a3450500015debd6b108c527d7260b82.webm?t=1750225419\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2578050/extras/a3450500015debd6b108c527d7260b82.mp4?t=1750225419\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Wishlist Fishing Echoes now and secure your spot on the shoreline. Can you become the ultimate angler and ensnare the legends?</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2578050/extras/47c3ec25b02eaa69e80001773bbe3177.avif?t=1750225419\" width=600 height=143 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Fishing Echoes, elemental forces await. Track down clues with each catch and get prepared for epic boss battles in this thrilling fishing adventure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2578050/extras/84eef0505d839c00590569145d2d73bf.avif?t=1750225419\" width=600 height=70 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2578050/extras/e1eca6088859d8d866d22cea7d72b342.avif?t=1750225419\" width=600 height=143 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2578050/extras/ab90f39ecbff3b3203154e5bfea51c9b.poster.avif?t=1750225419\" width=616 height=142 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2578050/extras/ab90f39ecbff3b3203154e5bfea51c9b.webm?t=1750225419\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2578050/extras/ab90f39ecbff3b3203154e5bfea51c9b.mp4?t=1750225419\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Elemental fish present a distinct challenge with their powerful statuses. These fish can manipulate elements to hinder your progress. Adapt your strategies, outwit their elemental tricks, and capture them to turn the tide in your favour.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2578050/extras/9c9e1827190cc19df76434bc76f87aac.poster.avif?t=1750225419\" width=616 height=142 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2578050/extras/9c9e1827190cc19df76434bc76f87aac.webm?t=1750225419\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2578050/extras/9c9e1827190cc19df76434bc76f87aac.mp4?t=1750225419\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Follow clues about fish habits to fine-tune your fishing techniques. Use this knowledge to outsmart and catch the most elusive fish. Master the art of tracking and adapt your approach to each fish. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2578050/extras/cc8d149ee28c165f8a8a6e17191c1951.poster.avif?t=1750225419\" width=616 height=142 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2578050/extras/cc8d149ee28c165f8a8a6e17191c1951.webm?t=1750225419\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2578050/extras/cc8d149ee28c165f8a8a6e17191c1951.mp4?t=1750225419\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect and complete your fish catalogue by catching every species. Fill your collection with rare and diverse catches! Showcase your achievements and become a master angler with a comprehensive and impressive collection.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2578050/extras/cde458703159db96c488d333fdc8e575.poster.avif?t=1750225419\" width=616 height=142 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2578050/extras/cde458703159db96c488d333fdc8e575.webm?t=1750225419\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2578050/extras/cde458703159db96c488d333fdc8e575.mp4?t=1750225419\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore how the shifting day-night cycle influences which fish are active. Tailor your fishing approach to different times and increase your chances of finding rare and unique species.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2578050/extras/82bbf41405192447e59d66a1e27a0fa6.poster.avif?t=1750225419\" width=616 height=142 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2578050/extras/82bbf41405192447e59d66a1e27a0fa6.webm?t=1750225419\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2578050/extras/82bbf41405192447e59d66a1e27a0fa6.mp4?t=1750225419\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Travel to distinctive biomes and uncover unique fishing spots. Explore new locations, expand your adventure, and conquer fresh challenges.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2578050/extras/a3450500015debd6b108c527d7260b82.poster.avif?t=1750225419\" width=616 height=142 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2578050/extras/a3450500015debd6b108c527d7260b82.webm?t=1750225419\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2578050/extras/a3450500015debd6b108c527d7260b82.mp4?t=1750225419\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Wishlist Fishing Echoes now and secure your spot on the shoreline. Can you become the ultimate angler and ensnare the legends?</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "short_description": "Set sail on a mystical fishing journey where fish fight back with elemental magic. Battle fire-breathing leviathans in molten rivers and outwit frost-casters in icy oceans. Can you uncover the source of a chaotic maelstrom threatening the realm and restore balance before it\u2019s too late?",
